  "segments": [
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.0,
      "text": "Journey to the West Chapter 83, the Melon Field"
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 14.0,
      "end": 16.0,
      "text": "Are you sure you can help?"
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 16.0,
      "end": 18.0,
      "text": "Wukong asked the Buddha, my Treya."
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 18.0,
      "end": 20.0,
      "text": "Yellowbrows is powerful."
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 20.0,
      "end": 23.0,
      "text": "He captured everyone with a magic cloth."
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 23.0,
      "end": 26.0,
      "text": "He trapped me in a pair of symbols."
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 26.0,
      "end": 28.0,
      "text": "I can defeat Yellowbrows."
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 29.0,
      "end": 30.0,
      "text": "Said my Treya."
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 30.0,
      "end": 32.0,
      "text": "He used to be my student."
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 32.0,
      "end": 37.0,
      "text": "The cloth and symbols are precious Buddhist treasures that he stole from me."
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 38.0,
      "end": 40.0,
      "text": "Wukong gulped."
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 40.0,
      "end": 44.0,
      "text": "Sorry, but I destroyed the symbols."
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 45.0,
      "end": 46.0,
      "text": "My Treya smiled."
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 46.0,
      "end": 48.0,
      "text": "Don't worry about that."
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 48.0,
      "end": 50.0,
      "text": "We must capture Yellowbrows."
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 50.0,
      "end": 52.0,
      "text": "I'll tell you my plan."
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 54.0,
      "end": 57.0,
      "text": "Wukong stormed up to the monastery door again."
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 58.0,
      "end": 59.0,
      "text": "Yellowbrows."
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 59.0,
      "end": 60.0,
      "text": "He shouted."
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 60.0,
      "end": 64.0,
      "text": "Return my friends are all smash your entire mountain."
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 64.0,
      "end": 68.0,
      "text": "The door flew open and Yellowbrows stepped out."
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 70.0,
      "end": 73.0,
      "text": "How dare you threaten me."
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 73.0,
      "end": 77.0,
      "text": "Do you know how powerful I am?"
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 77.0,
      "end": 79.0,
      "text": "You're not powerful."
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 79.0,
      "end": 80.0,
      "text": "Said the monkey."
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 80.0,
      "end": 83.0,
      "text": "You just thank you are because you have that cloth."
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 83.0,
      "end": 86.0,
      "text": "I bet you're too scared to fight me without it."
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 87.0,
      "end": 89.0,
      "text": "I'm not scared of you."
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 89.0,
      "end": 91.0,
      "text": "Said the demon."
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 91.0,
      "end": 95.0,
      "text": "He went back inside and came back a moment later."
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 95.0,
      "end": 99.0,
      "text": "He was holding a heavy wooden club."
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 99.0,
      "end": 104.0,
      "text": "Wukong pulled out his iron bar as the demon rushed toward him."
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 104.0,
      "end": 108.0,
      "text": "Wann, their weapons smashed together again and again."
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 108.0,
      "end": 112.0,
      "text": "As he fought the demon, Wukong took small steps backward."
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 113.0,
      "end": 117.0,
      "text": "Slowly he moved the fight away from the monastery."
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 121.0,
      "end": 125.0,
      "text": "Soon they were fighting in the valley at the bottom of the mountain."
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 125.0,
      "end": 130.0,
      "text": "Wukong took another swing at Yellowbrows and then pretended to be scared."
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 130.0,
      "end": 133.0,
      "text": "You are too powerful."
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 133.0,
      "end": 134.0,
      "text": "Cryed the monkey."
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 134.0,
      "end": 136.0,
      "text": "I can't fight you anymore."
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 136.0,
      "end": 138.0,
      "text": "He turned and ran away."
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 138.0,
      "end": 141.0,
      "text": "YELLED Yellowbrows."
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 142.0,
      "end": 144.0,
      "text": "Get back here, coward."
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "start": 144.0,
      "end": 147.0,
      "text": "The demon ran after Wukong."
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "start": 148.0,
      "end": 151.0,
      "text": "The monkey ran through some woods and..."
    }
  ]
